'''Starhawk speeder bikes''' were a model of [[speeder bike]] manufactured by [[Ikas-Adno]]. The Starhawk was outfitted with two [[blaster cannon]]s and could be equipped with a sidecar. This model was used extensively by the [[pirate]]s of the [[Ohnaka Gang]] throughout the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="AEYNTK" />

